  "topography": {
    "project_purpose": "KAIO, previously Libre Capital, is an institutional fund and real-world asset (RWA) platform focused on bringing regulated funds onchain. The project provides compliant fund tokenization and access infrastructure, interoperability across supported chains, liquidity access, mirrored/receipt token components, and a sovereign AppChain for regulated onchain fund distribution and management.",
